    "text": "OPENKAKAO · LOCAL\n\nJarvis 설정\n\n하나의 창에서 대상 방과 로컬 AI, 지식 상태를 확인합니다.\n\n대상 채팅방\nNIMDA 인수인계 임원방\n\n등록 1 · live 1 · 본문 미전달\n\nAI 모델\n온디바이스\nFlash-Next\nddalcu/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-Serve-mixed-4-8bit\n기본 상주\nQwen3.8 27B\nddalcu/Qwen3.8-27B-MLX-Serve-4bit\n온디맨드 스왑 · 미로딩\n\n현재 선택: ddalcu/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-Serve-mixed-4-8bit\n\n소유권 미확인 · 27B 전환 차단\n\n외부 런타임이 11234 포트를 점유 중 · 앱은 시작/중지하지 않습니다\n\n온디바이스: Apple M5 Max (128GB RAM) · MLX Core/Serve · 실추론 통과 (Qwen3.8 Flash-Next)\n\nVoice\n로컬 전용\n\n상태 idle · wake custom · RMS 0.000\n\n호출어: 헤이 자비스\n\n임계값: 0.65 고정\n\n한국어 커스텀 헤드: bundled ONNX 선택됨 (TTS 보정, 사람 음성 일반화 아님)\n\nRMS는 acoustic pulse lattice 진폭에만 반영됩니다. 영어 스톡 모델은 한국어 호출을 놓칩니다.\n\n마이크 세션 시작\n카카오 DB 동기화 · 색인\nGraphRAG 준비\n\n동기화: ready\n\n백그라운드 · 답변 대기 0 · 긱뉴스 idle · DB 동기화 ready\n\n격리 복제: copy_ok\n\n색인 모드: wal+isolated-copy+mode=ro+query_only\n\n마지막 색인: 1790005911 · indexed 31\n\ndense: indexed:50\n\nDREAM-RSI\n체크포인트 provenance\n\nstatus: evaluated · selected_policy: mirror_prompt_tail\n\ngold_rows: 400 · gold_source_policy: human_only\n\nKnowledge\nGraphRAG · ready\n\nE-R-E 5 nodes · 4 relations · 화면 최대 24 nodes\n\noverview · 최대 24 nodes\n+1 hop\n노드를 선택하면 2-hop으로 집중합니다.\n\nsubject · relation · object / room · time · evidence\n\n선택 시 기존 read-only GraphRAG retrieve를 사용합니다.\n\n아침\n대기\n점심\n대기\n저녁\n대기\nHistory\n안전 요약\n\n최근 1건 · 본문·프롬프트 제외\n\n09:41 · NIMDA 인수인계 임원방\n전송 · 정상 · 검색 ok",
    "html": "\n    <div id=\"app\" data-state=\"ready\"><main class=\"settings-shell\">\n    <header class=\"settings-header\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">OPENKAKAO · LOCAL</p>\n      <h1>Jarvis 설정</h1>\n      <p>하나의 창에서 대상 방과 로컬 AI, 지식 상태를 확인합니다.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"settings-card\" aria-labelledby=\"rooms-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"rooms-title\">대상 채팅방</h2><span class=\"status-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div>\n      <select id=\"settings-room-popup\" aria-label=\"대상 채팅방\"><option value=\"417780809780519\">NIMDA 인수인계 임원방</option></select>\n      <p id=\"room-summary\" class=\"muted\">등록 1 · live 1 · 본문 미전달</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"settings-card\" aria-labelledby=\"model-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"model-title\">AI 모델</h2><span class=\"tag\">온디바이스</span></div>\n      <button class=\"model-row selection\" type=\"button\" data-model-id=\"ddalcu/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-Serve-mixed-4-8bit\" aria-pressed=\"true\">\n        <span class=\"model-copy\"><strong>Flash-Next</strong><span class=\"model-id\">ddalcu/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-Serve-mixed-4-8bit</span></span><span class=\"tag\">기본 상주</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"model-row\" type=\"button\" data-model-id=\"ddalcu/Qwen3.8-27B-MLX-Serve-4bit\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n        <span class=\"model-copy\"><strong>Qwen3.8 27B</strong><span class=\"model-id\">ddalcu/Qwen3.8-27B-MLX-Serve-4bit</span></span><span class=\"tag muted-tag\">온디맨드 스왑 · 미로딩</span>\n      </button>\n      <p id=\"model-status\" class=\"muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">현재 선택: ddalcu/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-Serve-mixed-4-8bit</p>\n      <p id=\"model-owner-state\" class=\"muted\">소유권 미확인 · 27B 전환 차단</p>\n      <p id=\"mlx-server-state\" class=\"muted\">외부 런타임이 11234 포트를 점유 중 · 앱은 시작/중지하지 않습니다</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-hardware-status\" class=\"muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">온디바이스: Apple M5 Max (128GB RAM) · MLX Core/Serve · 실추론 통과 (Qwen3.8 Flash-Next)</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"settings-card\" aria-labelledby=\"voice-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"voice-title\">Voice</h2><span class=\"tag muted-tag\">로컬 전용</span></div>\n      <p id=\"voice-status\">상태 idle · wake custom · RMS 0.000</p>\n      <p id=\"voice-phrase\">호출어: 헤이 자비스</p>\n      <p id=\"voice-threshold\">임계값: 0.65 고정</p>\n      <p id=\"voice-custom\">한국어 커스텀 헤드: bundled ONNX 선택됨 (TTS 보정, 사람 음성 일반화 아님)</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">RMS는 acoustic pulse lattice 진폭에만 반영됩니다. 영어 스톡 모델은 한국어 호출을 놓칩니다.</p>\n      <button id=\"voice-start\" type=\"button\">마이크 세션 시작</button>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"settings-sync-card\" class=\"settings-card knowledge-accent\" aria-labelledby=\"sync-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"sync-title\">카카오 DB 동기화 · 색인</h2><span class=\"tag\">GraphRAG 준비</span></div>\n      <p id=\"settings-sync-source\">동기화: ready</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-activity-source\" class=\"muted\">백그라운드 · 답변 대기 0 · 긱뉴스 idle · DB 동기화 ready</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-sync-copy\">격리 복제: copy_ok</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-sync-mode\">색인 모드: wal+isolated-copy+mode=ro+query_only</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-sync-index\">마지막 색인: 1790005911 · indexed 31</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-sync-dense\">dense: indexed:50</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"settings-dream-rsi-card\" class=\"settings-card\" aria-labelledby=\"dream-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"dream-title\">DREAM-RSI</h2><span class=\"tag muted-tag\">체크포인트 provenance</span></div>\n      <p id=\"settings-dream-rsi-status\">status: evaluated · selected_policy: mirror_prompt_tail</p>\n      <p id=\"settings-dream-rsi-gold\">gold_rows: 400 · gold_source_policy: human_only</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"settings-knowledge-card\" class=\"settings-card knowledge-accent\" aria-labelledby=\"knowledge-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"knowledge-title\">Knowledge</h2><span id=\"knowledge-mode\" class=\"tag\">GraphRAG · ready</span></div>\n      <p id=\"knowledge-summary\">E-R-E 5 nodes · 4 relations · 화면 최대 24 nodes</p>\n      <div class=\"knowledge-hologram-shell\">\n        <canvas id=\"knowledge-graph-canvas\" width=\"1372\" height=\"640\" aria-label=\"Knowledge E-R-E hologram graph\" data-engine=\"three.js r180\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"knowledge-hologram-toolbar\">\n          <span id=\"knowledge-hop-label\">overview · 최대 24 nodes</span>\n          <button id=\"knowledge-expand-hop\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\">+1 hop</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"knowledge-focus-card\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <strong id=\"knowledge-focus-title\">노드를 선택하면 2-hop으로 집중합니다.</strong>\n        <p id=\"knowledge-focus-meta\">subject · relation · object / room · time · evidence</p>\n        <div id=\"knowledge-relations\" class=\"knowledge-relations\"></div>\n        <p id=\"knowledge-retrieve\">선택 시 기존 read-only GraphRAG retrieve를 사용합니다.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"slot-grid\" aria-label=\"GeekNews 슬롯\">\n        <span>아침 <b id=\"settings-slot-morning\">대기</b></span>\n        <span>점심 <b id=\"settings-slot-lunch\">대기</b></span>\n        <span>저녁 <b id=\"settings-slot-evening\">대기</b></span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"settings-card\" aria-labelledby=\"history-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"history-title\">History</h2><span class=\"tag muted-tag\">안전 요약</span></div>\n      <p id=\"history-summary\" class=\"muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">최근 1건 · 본문·프롬프트 제외</p>\n      <div id=\"history-list\" class=\"knowledge-relations\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"최근 답변 기록\"><div class=\"knowledge-relation-row\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>09:41 · NIMDA 인수인계 임원방</strong><span>전송 · 정상 · 검색 ok</span></div></div>\n    </section>\n  </main></div>\n  \n\n"
